<title>SWEDEN: Swedish 7.5 bln SKR T-bill auction oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Swedish 7.5 bln SKR T-bill auction oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Swedish auction of 7.5 million crowns of Treasury bills was heavily oversubscribed, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					     80 day bill     350 day bill</p>
<p> Volume issued (million Skr)	    499		 6,998</p>
<p> Total bids (million Skr)	     2,389		22,182</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		    2		    22</p>
<p> Number of bids				11		    85</p>
<p> Lowest rate				4.039		 4.450</p>
<p> Highest accepted rate		  4.039		 4.460</p>
<p> Weighted average rate		  4.039		 4.458</p>
<p> Percent served at highest rate     78.25		 31.19</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
